  "scope": "The Kitty animation frame-composition suite alone in one persistent (KeepOnClose, image policy 4) tab on a disposable macOS sidecar: two cases (whole-frame a=c compositions that replace and blend, and refused compositions that change nothing), over paired original offscreen PNGs and complete cells/modes. No stock collector ran, so there is no stock grade and no Core or common-harness claim; the pinned callbacks are replayed from the retained bundle and stay inconclusive by design. Not measured: an ordinary (non-persistent) tab on the desktop (unit tests only), rectangle offsets and sizes smaller than the image (pinned by unit tests; a partial composition is not one uniform color), a composition source or destination that is a PNG-encoded root (the root image is raw RGBA, f=32; only the added frame is PNG), a second client, remote persistent sessions, other platforms, a restart or reattach after composing.",
